                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yosia omiyo Hilikia jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam, jocway ri Were i wi migam ma joluwo go i dwoŋ, kodi jokur m'oyido jonitie i tic i waŋkac ma Ot pa Rwoth wodho woko gigipiny je m'oyido ioro ma lamo Bal, were madhako Asera, kodi micalin. Kere owaŋo woko gigipiny me je woko ma tindi madwoŋ cegin gi milelo Kidiron, to tero buru mere i Bethel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oriemo woko i tic jocway ri Were i wi migam ma kerin ma Yuda oyido joketho miyo cowirok i wi migam manyakafir i tindin madongo ma Yuda kodi i kabedo macegin gi Yerusalem. Kiri jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jowaŋo buban ri Bal, waŋceŋ, dwe, pondeponde, kodi micalin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owodho woko cal pa Asera i Ot pa Rwoth, otero woko ma tindi madwoŋ i milelo Kidiron, owaŋo to odo buru mere i fukefuke, aka oywoyo i limbo pa ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere bende oturo woko udi pa cwo kodi mon m'oyido jobedo malayin i Ot pa Rwoth. (Kenyo a kama mon oyido jokwoyo iye kanzin ma lamo Asera.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okelo i Yerusalem jocway ri Were i wi migam m'oyido jonitie i tindin madongo ma Yuda, to loko makoc migame m'oyido jomiyo iye cowirok. Go bende oturo piny migame m'oyido omiy ri jwogi diegi cegin gi waŋkac ma Yosuwa gavana ma tindi madwoŋ ogeto, yuracam ma waŋkac madwoŋ ka idonjo i tindi madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jocway ri Were i wi migam me oyido kiyey jo tic i Ot pa Rwoth, to oyido jonyalo camo mugat ma buthow m'imiyo jocway ri Were i wi migam wadi jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
