                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Yosia bende oloko makoc Tofeth, kalamo manyakafir i milelo Hinom, ŋey wongoye ŋata nyalo miyo wode kosa nyare paka cowirok ma mic awaŋa ri were Molek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bende okwanyo woko kayinin ma kerin ma Yuda oyido joketho gicen ma lamo waŋceŋ, to waŋo cawilin m'oyido ioro i lamo me. Oyido ikano jo i diedipo ma Ot pa Rwoth, cegin gi waŋkac aka oyido kibor gi kama jadhum madwoŋ Nathan Melek oyido bed'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kerin 21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kigana 33:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Yosia oturo piny migame m'oyido kerin ma Yuda jogeto i wi cel pa kere malo ma kisika ma kere Ahaz oyido ogeto, kanyacel gi migame ma kere Manase ogeto i diedipo ario ma Ot pa Rwoth; oŋinyo migame mathindho thindho to bolo i milelo Kidiron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Yosia bende oloko makoc migame ma kere Solomon oyido ogeto yupodho ceŋ ma Yerusalem, yupiny ma got Oliv, ma lamo cal ma mienirok kodi ri Asitate were madhako ma Sidon, Kemos were ma Mowab, kodi Molek were ma Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Yosia oturo sirin ma tele mathindho thindho, otoŋo piny were madhako Asera, to umo piny kam'oyido jocungo iye gi cokin pa ji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
