            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Yosia bende oturo piny kalamo ma kere Yerobowam wod pa Nebat m'omiyo Joisiraili timo reco oyido ogeto i Bethel. Oŋinyo telin mere mathindho thindho to odo i fukefuke, aka owaŋo cal pa Asera bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo kere Yosia oŋiyo korin gi korin to neno kaliele mogo kenyo i wi tendere. Owaco wogol woko cokin mere wowaŋ i wi migam ŋey wokiri woor kendo. Gime otimere paka jatuci wac Were moro owaco munyo kere Yerobowam oyido ocungo i wi migam no i kalima moro. Kere Yosia oŋiyo korin gi korin aka oneno kaliel pa jatuci wac Were m'owaco ni gigipiny me bino timere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.30+1KI.13.31+1KI.13.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kerin 13:30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka openjo ni, “Meno kaliel pa ŋa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
